---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { breadcrumbSchema, businessSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const title = 'About AyiTess | Carpenter and handyman in Barnsley';
const description = 'AyiTess Ltd is based in Barnsley. Carpentry, handyman work, painting, moves, clearance and cleaning for homes and small businesses.';
---

<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path="/about"
  jsonLd={[
    businessSchema(),
    breadcrumbSchema([
      { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
      { name: 'About', path: '/about' },
    ]),
  ]}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="content" class="page">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span>About</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
    <h1>A Barnsley firm that does the work</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        AyiTess Ltd is a private company, number {site.companyNumber}, incorporated on 5 March 2022.
        The Facebook page places the business in Barnsley. There is no shop counter. The crew comes to the house, the office, or the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        The day-to-day work is carpentry and handyman jobs, plus painting, snagging, jet washing, and looking after properties for landlords and small firms.
        The same company also moves houses and offices, clears non-hazardous waste, cleans, puts up scaffolding and netting, does garden work, and collects IT kit for recycling.
      </p>
      <h2>Who you will speak to</h2>
      <p>
        Rose is the name that comes up most when people write about the first phone call. She takes the details and stays in touch.
        On the tools, customers have named Aaron, Daniel, Ben, Brian, Kyle, DJ, Danny, and Ali. Who turns up depends on the job.
      </p>
      <h2>Who we work for</h2>
      <p>
        Homeowners, landlords, shops, offices, and public-sector sites when the job fits. Our own advert says the work runs across the United Kingdom.
        For a door or a flat pack, that usually means Yorkshire. For a full move or a big clearance, we will book further if the date and the access are clear.
      </p>
      <h2>What we will not pretend</h2>
      <p>
        We do not do gas work. We do not rewire houses or open fuse boards. We do not take asbestos or chemical waste.
        If a repair needs a specialist, or a listed building needs consent, we say so before we start.
      </p>
      <p>
        People also join the crew as staff or as subcontractors. If that is you, use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> and say what trade you cover.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
